libc++ (LLVM 18): std::invoke_result_t of a std::__bind_back closure (N5008
[meta.trans.other], [func.require]).  Fixed by
cpp11_class_pack_expanded_in_member_trailing_return and
cpp11_namespace_scope_decltype_deduces_full_pack (found by cvise
